## Fix the scope

- Review exactly the review revision plus its uncommitted scope.
- Read each changed hunk with its whole function/class and the callers it can break.
- Legacy debt outside the change is a note, never a blocker.

## Read-only

Never edit code, tests, generated files or dependencies. Any edit — even a comment — is a new revision to review.

## Order

1. Bug-hunt (cold, from the code).
2. Read the plan, decisions ({{decision_notation}}), goals and AC.
3. Grade the axes and rerun their gates.
4. Findings → verdict → report.

